{:edb/db-before-t 1076 :edb/db-after-t 1077 :edb/tx-data [[13194139534389 50 #inst "2026-10-06T23:41:27.130Z" 13194139534389 true] [17592186114979 1100 "Represent the following system of equations using matrices:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}2x=5 \\\\ -5x+6y=-8\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534389 true] [17592186114979 1100 "Represent the following system of equations using matrices:\n${2x = 5; - 5x + 6y =-8$" 13194139534389 false] [17592186114979 1145 "First, let's write the system so that both $x$ and $y$ appear in each equation. The variable $y$ does not appear in the first equation, but this just means its coefficient is $0$. So, we get\n\n$$\n{2x + 0y = 5; - 5x + 6y =-8\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form\n\n$$\nA\\mathbf{x} = \\mathbf{b}\n$$\n\nwhere\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 \\\\ -5 & 6\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ -8\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation\n\n$$\nA\\mathbf{x} = \\mathbf{b}\n$$\n\nbecomes\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 \\\\ -5 & 6\\end{bmatrix}\n$$" 13194139534389 false] [17592186114979 1145 "First, let's write the system so that both $x$ and $y$ appear in each equation. The variable $y$ does not appear in the first equation, but this just means its coefficient is $0.$ So, we get\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}2x+0y=5 \\\\ -5x+6y=-8\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $A\\mathbf{x} = \\mathbf{b},$ where\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 \\\\ -5 & 6\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ -8\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $A\\mathbf{x} = \\mathbf{b}$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 \\\\ -5 & 6\\end{aligned}]\n$$" 13194139534389 true] [17592186114980 1100 "Represent the following system of equations using matrices:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}-5y=-3x \\\\ 6+x=-2+y\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534389 true] [17592186114980 1100 "Represent the following system of equations using matrices:\n${-5y =-3x; 6 + x =-2 + y$" 13194139534389 false] [17592186114980 1145 "First, we organize the system so that it’s in the correct order:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}3x-5y=0 \\\\ x-y=-8.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $A\\mathbf{x} = \\mathbf{b},$ where\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}3 & -5 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ -8\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $A\\mathbf{x} = \\mathbf{b}$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}3 & -5 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{aligned}]\n$$" 13194139534389 true] [17592186114980 1145 "First, we organize the system so that it’s in the correct order:\n\n$$\n{3x - 5y = 0; x - y =-8\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form\n\n$$\nA\\mathbf{x} = \\mathbf{b}\n$$\n\nwhere\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -5 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -8\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation\n\n$$\nA\\mathbf{x} = \\mathbf{b}\n$$\n\nbecomes\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -5 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$" 13194139534389 false] [17592186114981 1100 "What is the system of equations represented by\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}10 & -15 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$" 13194139534389 true] [17592186114981 1100 "What is the system of equations represented by\n$\\begin{bmatrix}10 & -15 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$" 13194139534389 false] [17592186114981 1145 "The  $2\\times 2$ matrix represents the coefficients of $x$ and $y,$ while the $2\\times 1$ column vector on the right-hand side represents the constants of the equations. So, we get the following system of equations:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}10x-15y=5 \\\\ 1x+0y=-2\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSimplifying both equations in the system, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}2x-3y=1 \\\\ x=-2.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534389 true] [17592186114981 1145 "The $2\\times 2$ matrix represents the coefficients of $x$ and $y$, while the $2\\times 1$ column vector on the right-hand side represents the constants of the equations. So, we get the following system of equations:\n\n$$\n{10x - 15y = 5; 1x + 0y =-2\n$$\n\nSimplifying both equations in the system, we get\n\n$$\n{2x - 3y = 1; x =-2\n$$" 13194139534389 false] [17592186115151 1020 #edb/ref 17592186285588 13194139534389 true] [17592186115151 1020 #edb/ref 17592186285598 13194139534389 true] [17592186115151 1020 #edb/ref 17592186285607 13194139534389 true] [17592186115151 1020 #edb/ref 17592186285617 13194139534389 true] [17592186115151 1020 #edb/ref 17592186285650 13194139534389 true] [17592186115152 1020 #edb/ref 17592186285546 13194139534389 true] [17592186115152 1020 #edb/ref 17592186285553 13194139534389 true] [17592186115152 1020 #edb/ref 17592186285560 13194139534389 true] [17592186115152 1020 #edb/ref 17592186285626 13194139534389 true] [17592186115152 1020 #edb/ref 17592186285636 13194139534389 true] [17592186115153 1020 #edb/ref 17592186285567 13194139534389 true] [17592186115153 1020 #edb/ref 17592186285574 13194139534389 true] [17592186115153 1020 #edb/ref 17592186285581 13194139534389 true] [17592186115153 1020 #edb/ref 17592186285645 13194139534389 true] [17592186115652 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139534389 true] [17592186115652 1100 "What is the system of equations represented by\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}2 & -5 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}10 \\\\ -7\\end{aligned}]?\n$$" 13194139534389 true] [17592186115652 1100 "What is the system of equations represented by\n\n$\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -5 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix} = \\begin{bmatrix}10 \\\\ -7\\end{bmatrix}$?" 13194139534389 false] [17592186115652 1145 "The  $2\\times 2$ matrix represents the coefficients of $x$ and $y,$ while the $2\\times 1$ column vector on the right-hand side represents the constants of the equations. So, we get the following system of equations:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}2x-5y=10 \\\\ x+0y=-7\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSimplifying both equations in the system, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}2x-5y=10 \\\\ x=-7\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534389 true] [17592186285546 1017 #edb/ref 17592186285547 13194139534389 true] [17592186285546 1089 "q-130510" 13194139534389 true] [17592186285546 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139534389 true] [17592186285546 1100 "Represent the following system of equations using matrices:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}3x-1=4y \\\\ y=-4\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534389 true] [17592186285546 1113 #uuid "653bbc46-49d8-5a42-a29a-f56c9b28ffda" 13194139534389 true] [17592186285546 1145 "First, we organize the system so that it’s in the correct order and  both $x$ and $y$ appear in each equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}3x-4y=1 \\\\ 0x+y=-4\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}3 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -4\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}3 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -4\\end{aligned}].\n$$" 13194139534389 true] [17592186285547 1000